   "chapter": 0,
   "movement": "",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "say": "The answer to him came as six sparks, carried to a lake of reeds and raised as one child. In the tradition kept at Thai Poosam, his mother places a spear in his hand: the vel.",
