   "chapter": 0,
   "movement": "",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "say": "And here the Kanda Puranam of Kachiyappa tells what happened next. One half rises as a rooster. The other as a peacock. And they come at him still, in fury. Then, the text says, a single look of grace, and the enmity is gone. Murugan sets the rooster on his banner, and mounts the peacock.",
   "ref": null,
