   "chapter": 0,
   "movement": "",
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "say": "The Saiva Siddhanta teachers read Surapadman as the sense of \"I\" that will not bend. On that reading he was never only out there. The anger at the door, the scrolling at midnight: we add those ourselves, as his tree, hiding in plain sight.",
